# Kodaelus (project stub)

For use in any project without copying this repo, run once from the Kodaelus distribution folder:

```bash
npm run install:global
```

That installs:

- `~/.cursor/kodaelus/core.md` (always-on policy)
- `~/.cursor/kodaelus/modes/` (one file per mode)
- `~/.cursor/kodaelus/tasks/` (task modules)
- `~/.cursor/kodaelus/policy-manifest.json` (task packs and self-check fragments)
- `~/.cursor/kodaelus/instructions.md` (redirect stub only, not the full policy)
- `~/.cursor/agents/kodaelus.md`, `kodaelus-bug.md`, and `kodaelus-prompt.md`

Select **kodaelus** (Main), **kodaelus-bug** (Bug Investigation), or **kodaelus-prompt** (Planner / Prompt) from the agent menu.

Read `core.md`, then one mode file, then the files `policy-manifest.json` lists. Do not treat `instructions.md` as the policy.
